SUMMARY:Stuffed Chocolate Bar Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hands-on chocolate experience inspired by the viral Dubai-style chocolate bars! In this interactive class\, participants will create their own indulgent chocolate bar using premium chocolate and rich fillings. Participants will learn step-by-step techniques for molding\, layering\, filling\, and decorating their chocolate bar . This class is beginner-friendly\, and perfect for families\, friends\, and chocolate lovers of all ages. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
