SUMMARY:4th Annual Music Against Hunger Benefit Concert
DESCRIPTION:The 4th Annual Music Against Hunger Benefit Concert\, sponsored by NJ Arts\, will take place at Tierney’s Tavern in Montclair at 7:30 on Saturday\, April 18\, to support Toni’s Kitchen.\nDoors will open at 7:00. \nThe Event will feature Big Mamou (at 9:30)\, Doug Hall & Friends (at 8:30)\, and The Reticents (at 7:30)\, in an evening featuring many of Montclair’s top musicians. \n“We’ve had so much fun at these fundraisers\, which have been effective in supporting Toni’s Kitchen\,” said Hall\, “we wanted to keep it going—for the 4th year in a row—\nto continue helping in the fight against food insecurity\, which is surprisingly prevalent in our area.” \nSuggested donation at the door is $20. All proceeds will benefit Toni’s Kitchen\, a food ministry which provides healthy food to individuals and families in need.\nFor more info contact Doug Hall at doughall27@gmail.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
